<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo sets 500 mln mark three-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo sets 500 mln mark three-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Dresdner Kleinwort Benson.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKENBANK FRANKFURT</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    04.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    04.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   17 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   =	   REOFFER    =</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    7 BP	SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
